[14.795735, "o", "8;2;255;255;255m3.\u001b[6GBoth \u001b[12Geport historyId=1 in their\u001b[39Gown\u001b[43Gworktree. Ask bleep to compare the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   runs: history diff-timing with directory=<MAIN>/../wt-seeded, base=1,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gtarget=1, baseDirectory=<MAIN>/../\u001b[41Gt-c\u001b[45Gld.\u001b[39m                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m4.\u001b[6GPrint, with r\u001b[20Gal numbers from the tool results:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   agent[seeded]  copy-state: <bytes> bytes in <ms>  ->  first compile: success\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gage\u001b[11G[cold]\u001b[18G   first compile:\u001b[36Gsuccess (compiled everything from scratch)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bbl\u001b[9Gep history\u001b[20Gdiff-timing (cold -\u001b[41Gseeded):\u001b[50Gtotal\u001b[56G<baseMs>ms -> <targetMs>m\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bverdict: <one\u001b[20Gsentence with the ratio>\u001b[39m                                  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mThen stop.\u001b[39m                                                                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b"]
